# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Activate Hidden Courtyard's Discover 4 ability and cast the eligible card.
# Forcing: The scripted path must activate the land because Llanowar Elves starts in the library.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no hand or battlefield choices and cannot interrupt the activation.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN   = the activated Discover path cast Llanowar Elves.
#   LOSE  = the ability or discovered cast did not complete before the turn limit.
#   TIMEOUT = activation, cost payment, or the cast choice failed to advance.
# Card roles:
#   Hidden Courtyard — source of the activated Discover ability.
#   Plains — pays the five-mana activation cost.
#   Llanowar Elves — deterministic eligible Discover result.
# Protocol path: Activate action, Ability object, LinkInfo type 2, free-cast choice, and zone transfers.

